Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Beach Head 2003 Desert War (Global VR): the cabinet's registry. The frontend's ActiveX control
; (C:\Orion\ShellControl.ocx, its regsvr32 registration, safe for scripting and initializing as
; the cabinet's Internet Explorer settings let it run) and the multigame shell's settings, from
; the game's install CD (its _Registry, copied to the dump: stand/nogames.reg,
; plug/GVRShell_desertwar.reg, update/GVRShell_Multi.reg, in its setup's order), with free play
; and the stand-up cabinet (MachineType 0: the joystick turret, not the Vortek headset). Imported
; at each launch: the payload then restores what the shell changed (operator settings, audits,
; high scores, coins), saved in the dump's MULTIGAME_Shell/gvrshell-saved.reg.

